# Park-Me

Park-Me is a simple and efficient parking app that helps users quickly find the nearest parking lots, view real-time spot availability, compare prices, and read genuine reviews from other users. Say goodbye to endless searching and circling — Park-Me puts all the information you need right at your fingertips.

## Features

- **Find Nearest Parking:** Instantly locate the closest parking lots based on your current location.
- **Live Availability:** View how many spots are available in each lot in real-time.
- **Price Comparison:** Check and compare parking prices before making your choice.
- **User Reviews:** Read feedback and reviews from other people about each parking lot.
- **Simple Interface:** Easy-to-use design for a fast and stress-free experience.

## How It Works

1. **Open Park-Me:** The app will request your location to show nearby parking lots.
2. **Browse Lots:** See a list or map view of nearby parking options with availability and pricing.
3. **Check Reviews:** Tap on any parking lot to see honest reviews and ratings from other drivers.
4. **Navigate & Park:** Select your spot and follow directions to the lot.

